# Hold step 1 (it has a note) and press step 5: its note ends with step 5
# (120 ticks); step 5 again: with its start (96); step 2: 48. Step 1's
# release then toggles nothing. Hold step 5 and press step 3, before it:
# nothing.
--button 0.05:SEQ
--key 0.10:0:100:0.6
--key 0.20:7:100:0.05
--key 0.35:7:100:0.05
--key 0.50:2:100:0.05
--key 0.90:7:100:0.4
--key 1.00:4:100:0.05
--button 1.40:PLAY/STOP
